      "notes": "Read-only comparison of source_digest values that earlier reads returned, for up to 100 {id, observed_source_digest} entries naming canonical WK-#### records. Each resolves to unchanged, changed (with current_source_digest), absent (missing_json_record), or unreadable (with loader diagnostic codes); absent and unreadable never collapse into changed. total_count, returned_count, and has_more bound the answer, and unchecked_ids names every unresolved identity. Use the 16-hex source_digest a read returned. It returns no content and replaces neither fresh reads nor write CAS.",
