      ],
      "notes": "Agent-safe MCP route for record- or slice-level status updates on a configured workspace repository through validated persistence; caller filesystem roots, policy carriers, raw JSON patches, and unsupported fields refuse. A malformed or stale expected_source_digest refuses before the request is classified. Under DEC-0177 an ordinary done is not refused for completion_policy forge_confirmed_merge, and supplies no forge merge evidence. A completion that also records authored closure is one call to workspace_work_record_set_closure with status done. A transition to review or done that changes canonical bytes runs the generated-view and lint checks once, through generateAndLint as the sole executor, reporting a failing check as failing and an unavailable one as not run with its cause, neither as a rollback. A request that changed nothing reports no_canonical_mutation and runs none. When its findings exceed the bounded answer, the complete receipt is retained once and root next_calls reads its findings through workspace_work_record_summary without repeating the write or checks; lint results are repository-scoped (lint_scope repository).",
      "use_when": [
        "work_record_mutation",
        "mutation_operation=status"
