      ],
      "notes": "Compact read-only summary for a selected WK or slice. Default output is lean: ok, unit, actual status, a bounded title summary, and at most three role-callable next calls. details:{offset,limit} (default 3, maximum 5) lists live role-visible selected routes. ordinary_field selects root/slice summary, why_it_matters, agent_notes, or one task's text as exact references; reference_only omits bodies, literal selection returns before/match/after references, and text pages default to 512, cap 1024 scalars. member:{path} (id or unit=<WK-ID>#<slice-id>) pages one field or string range, members:[...] reads 1-16 in one bounded call, selected_record:true returns write_scope, acceptance and validation, slice_offset/slice_limit/slice_status page slices; pages pin the 16-hex source_digest. No whole-record mode. References, review_purpose and terminal_review_designation are advisory facts that authorize nothing. receipt:{ref_id,sha256} with the unit, from a closeout response, reads that original receipt: its effects, repository-scoped lint facts and every finding identity; adding finding_id returns that original finding. It is exclusive of other selectors and repeats no write or check.",
